      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos\\left(x+\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$. Enter the signed coefficients.\n\n$\\cos\\left(x+\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)=$ {{field-1}} $\\sin x\\,+$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$",
